category: Math
build-depends: cygport gcc-fortran libgmp-devel libguile3.0-devel octave-devel python3-devel python312-numpy swig
sdesc: "Non-linear optimization library (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "NLopt is a free/open-source library for nonlinear optimization, providing a
common interface for a number of different free optimization routines
available online as well as original implementations of various other
algorithms."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/stevengj/nlopt
license: LGPL-2.1-or-later AND MIT AND BSD-3-Clause
